  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あつく　やけた　すなを\nあいてに　ぶつけて　こうげきする。\nやけど　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뜨겁게 달궈진 모래를\n상대에게 부딪쳐서 공격한다.\n화상 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "向對手投灑熾熱的沙子進行攻擊。\n有時會讓對手陷入灼傷狀態。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur projette du sable chauffé à blanc\nsur l’ennemi. Peut aussi brûler la cible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift das Ziel mit brennend heißem\nSand an und fügt ihm eventuell Verbrennungen zu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca al objetivo arrojándole arena a temperaturas muy\nelevadas. Puede causar quemaduras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio scagliandogli addosso\ndella sabbia incandescente. Può anche scottarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user throws scorching sand at the target to attack.\nThis may also leave the target with a burn.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "熱く　焼けた　砂を\n相手に　ぶつけて　攻撃する。\nやけど状態に　することが　ある。",
